# Build context for pet-agent/Dockerfile is this whole directory (see that
# Dockerfile's own top comment for why). Docker only ever reads the single
# .dockerignore that sits at the ROOT of the build context - it does NOT also
# read pet-agent/.dockerignore or pet-mcp/.dockerignore once the context is
# widened to here, so this file has to redo, for every one of the four
# projects that get COPY'd in, what each project's own .dockerignore already
# did for its narrower, single-project build.
#
# The one entry that matters most: pet-agent/.env.dev (and any other
# .env.$APP_ENV profile file) can hold a real LLM API key once a developer has
# filled it in locally. Without the lines below, `COPY pet-agent pet-agent`
# would copy it straight into an image layer - exactly what ONBOARDING.md's
# Step 9 text explicitly forbids ("must not be stored in an image"). Every
# project-scoped .dockerignore below is complete on its own (real secrets are
# ALWAYS excluded, even for a project not currently reachable through
# pet-agent/Dockerfile's own COPY list), rather than only covering what this
# one Dockerfile happens to copy today.
#
# pet-agent/Dockerfile 的构建上下文是这整个目录(原因见那份 Dockerfile 自己
# 最上面的注释)。Docker 只会读位于构建上下文*根目录*的那一份 .dockerignore——
# 一旦上下文变成这一层,它就不会再去读 pet-agent/.dockerignore 或
# pet-mcp/.dockerignore 了,所以这份文件必须替下面复制进来的四个项目,把它们
# 各自那份(只管自己单项目构建时)的 .dockerignore 该做的事,重新做一遍。
#
# 这里最要紧的一条:pet-agent/.env.dev(以及任何其他 .env.$APP_ENV профиль
# 文件)一旦开发者在本地填好了,就可能带着真实的 LLM API 密钥。没有下面这几
# 行的话,`COPY pet-agent pet-agent` 就会把它原样拷进镜像层——这正是
# ONBOARDING.md 第 9 步文字里明确禁止的("不能存进镜像里")。下面每个项目各
# 自的一段都是完整的(真正的密钥永远被排除在外,即便这个项目今天并不在
# pet-agent/Dockerfile 的 COPY 列表里),而不只是覆盖这份 Dockerfile 今天恰好
# 用到的部分。

# ---- common, every project ----
**/.git
**/.github
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/build
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/docs
**/site
**/.devcontainer
**/*.log
**/.vscode
**/.claude
**/mkdocs.yml
**/codecov.yaml
**/.pre-commit-config.yaml
**/.editorconfig
**/tox.ini

# ---- secrets and local env, every project - inject at runtime, never bake
# into an image ----
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.shared
!**/.env.*.example

# ---- this scratch build-transfer file, if it is ever present at the root ----
.docker-build-scratch.tar.gz

# ---- pet-mcp / pet-agent only: their own Dockerfile/compose files are not
# needed inside a build that already has its own Dockerfile at the top of
# this context ----
pet-mcp/Dockerfile
pet-mcp/docker-compose*.yml
pet-mcp/Makefile
pet-agent/docker-compose*.yml
pet-agent/Makefile

# ---- petstore-api: not part of pet-agent/Dockerfile's COPY list, excluded
# defensively for the same reason as the others ----
petstore-api/README.md
